(3204817, 449760, 46314, '<td valign="top">Yeah, I was sure there would be a literal representation of this one. It''s funny. Nice capture of the action, but I think the composition could have been worked out better. Maybe a tighter crop to get more impact out of the sugar hitting the liquid. Or maybe just cropping off the top third, to establish the centre of attention away from the middle of the pic where it is now to a better focal point.</td>', 'Yeah, I was sure there would be a literal representation of this one. It''s funny. Nice capture of the action, but I think the composition could have been worked out better. Maybe a tighter crop to get more impact out of the sugar hitting the liquid. Or maybe just cropping off the top third, to establish the centre of attention away from the middle of the pic where it is now to a better focal point.', '2007-01-10 08:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
