(3205026, 447093, 46314, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful. I love the colour of the sky, and your DOF/sharpness is brilliant. I also like the way you''ve processed it to have that patch of colour around the light, yet keeping the rest of the snow monochrome. The whole scene looks really desolate and far away.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful. I love the colour of the sky, and your DOF/sharpness is brilliant. I also like the way you''ve processed it to have that patch of colour around the light, yet keeping the rest of the snow monochrome. The whole scene looks really desolate and far away.', '2007-01-10 09:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205032, 450591, 46314, '<td valign="top">A bit off-focus - or maybe that was just camera shake from using a slow shutter speed in low light. I''ve had that problem with aquarium shots before.</td>', 'A bit off-focus - or maybe that was just camera shake from using a slow shutter speed in low light. I''ve had that problem with aquarium shots before.', '2007-01-10 09:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
