(3205103, 447412, 46314, '<td valign="top">Focus and depth of field are poor. I like the idea, but maybe it could have been conveyed better if your head had actually been in the picture, like sitting at a desk with the same sheets of meaningless numbers splayed out in front of you. That might have given more of a focal point and interest to the viewer, whereas now it is just a flat image that doesn''t hold much interest.</td>', 'Focus and depth of field are poor. I like the idea, but maybe it could have been conveyed better if your head had actually been in the picture, like sitting at a desk with the same sheets of meaningless numbers splayed out in front of you. That might have given more of a focal point and interest to the viewer, whereas now it is just a flat image that doesn''t hold much interest.', '2007-01-10 09:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
