(3205555, 450002, 46314, '<td valign="top">Clever, but there doesn''t seem to be a clear point of interest, and the whole shot is slightly out of focus. If you''d used the shallow DOF to get a selective focus on the lines of the page, it might have strengthened the image.</td>', 'Clever, but there doesn''t seem to be a clear point of interest, and the whole shot is slightly out of focus. If you''d used the shallow DOF to get a selective focus on the lines of the page, it might have strengthened the image.', '2007-01-10 10:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205559, 450841, 71060, '<td valign="top">Love it!</td>', 'Love it!', '2007-01-10 10:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205561, 450831, 67489, '<td valign="top">Hilarious!! I think this is awesome.</td>', 'Hilarious!! I think this is awesome.', '2007-01-10 10:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205565, 450600, 15711, '<td valign="top">I adore this.  Great composition.  I like the deepening of the tones around the edges. 8</td>', 'I adore this.  Great composition.  I like the deepening of the tones around the edges. 8', '2007-01-10 10:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205568, 450391, 43774, '<td valign="top">I don''t see this title in the list of songs you had to choose from</td>', 'I don''t see this title in the list of songs you had to choose from', '2007-01-10 10:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205577, 450495, 43774, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but this is just disgusting</td>', 'I''m sorry but this is just disgusting', '2007-01-10 10:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205578, 449815, 46314, '<td valign="top">What''s with the colour of the cat''s claws?</td>', 'What''s with the colour of the cat''s claws?', '2007-01-10 10:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205581, 450558, 46314, '<td valign="top">Very strong composition. Nice tones, which must have been difficult to acheive given that flat lighting.</td>', 'Very strong composition. Nice tones, which must have been difficult to acheive given that flat lighting.', '2007-01-10 10:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205586, 450242, 46314, '<td valign="top">Funny. Would be even better in brighter lighting to make it look like one of those show-room or auto-display shots.</td>', 'Funny. Would be even better in brighter lighting to make it look like one of those show-room or auto-display shots.', '2007-01-10 10:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205587, 450495, 70661, '<td valign="top">ewww...pooh!</td>', 'ewww...pooh!', '2007-01-10 10:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205593, 450008, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed.</td>', 'Nicely executed.', '2007-01-10 10:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205601, 450128, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice night shot. If you''d turned the model''s head away, looking out into the distance, it might have conveyed the idea of ''far away'' better by directing the viewer''s interest into the distance, and you would have overcome the motion blur problem you faced on a long exposure like this (because most of him is sharp, it''s just the face that is difficult to keep still).</td>', 'Nice night shot. If you''d turned the model''s head away, looking out into the distance, it might have conveyed the idea of ''far away'' better by directing the viewer''s interest into the distance, and you would have overcome the motion blur problem you faced on a long exposure like this (because most of him is sharp, it''s just the face that is difficult to keep still).', '2007-01-10 10:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205609, 450550, 46314, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot. Everything in the shot works to make that tent a powerful focal point, from the lighting and colour to leading lines in the sand on the dune and the lines of the horizon. Spectacular.</td>', 'Awesome shot. Everything in the shot works to make that tent a powerful focal point, from the lighting and colour to leading lines in the sand on the dune and the lines of the horizon. Spectacular.', '2007-01-10 10:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205612, 450803, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and focus.  It seems a tad flat.  Probably the light.  Maybe some post editing work could tweak it - possibly curves or levels adjusting.</td>', 'I like the composition and focus.  It seems a tad flat.  Probably the light.  Maybe some post editing work could tweak it - possibly curves or levels adjusting.', '2007-01-10 10:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205616, 450683, 46314, '<td valign="top">I like the dreamy soft focus. I also like the depth of field: the background is blurred enough to not distract from the gull, but it is also detailed enough to provide another layer of interest for the viewer.</td>', 'I like the dreamy soft focus. I also like the depth of field: the background is blurred enough to not distract from the gull, but it is also detailed enough to provide another layer of interest for the viewer.', '2007-01-10 10:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205618, 449849, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL  That is hilarious.  Great DOF and focus. Love the composition and the black nails. 7</td>', 'ROFL  That is hilarious.  Great DOF and focus. Love the composition and the black nails. 7', '2007-01-10 10:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205621, 449449, 15711, '<td valign="top">Cool old T-bird. Interesting perspective. Love the reflection of the pavement in the chrome. The sky is wonderful.</td>', 'Cool old T-bird. Interesting perspective. Love the reflection of the pavement in the chrome. The sky is wonderful.', '2007-01-10 10:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205627, 449144, 46314, '<td valign="top">The angle doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'The angle doesn''t work for me.', '2007-01-10 10:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205644, 449854, 4747, '<td valign="top">That''s a fabulous photo, I think it could be improved if you had just cropped the fend rail from the bottom and maybe the left side so the tree isn''t dead center.<br/>Regardless, it''s very cool.</td>', 'That''s a fabulous photo, I think it could be improved if you had just cropped the fend rail from the bottom and maybe the left side so the tree isn''t dead center.Regardless, it''s very cool.', '2007-01-10 10:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205655, 450294, 60910, '<td valign="top">one of my favorites!</td>', 'one of my favorites!', '2007-01-10 10:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205665, 447911, 60910, '<td valign="top">ohhhhh, my favorite jeans in all the world!!! :)</td>', 'ohhhhh, my favorite jeans in all the world!!! :)', '2007-01-10 10:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205670, 450462, 60910, '<td valign="top">great shot, very dark, but it''s working..</td>', 'great shot, very dark, but it''s working..', '2007-01-10 10:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205672, 449792, 46314, '<td valign="top">Wow. I''ve never seen these things before in my life, and yet I''ve already seen two of them in this challenge. They do seem like interesting subjects for photography.</td>', 'Wow. I''ve never seen these things before in my life, and yet I''ve already seen two of them in this challenge. They do seem like interesting subjects for photography.', '2007-01-10 10:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205673, 450796, 60910, '<td valign="top">wow, emotive!</td>', 'wow, emotive!', '2007-01-10 10:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205674, 450505, 60910, '<td valign="top">hysterical!</td>', 'hysterical!', '2007-01-10 10:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205680, 449976, 60910, '<td valign="top">awesome work!</td>', 'awesome work!', '2007-01-10 10:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205681, 450020, 60910, '<td valign="top">very creative!</td>', 'very creative!', '2007-01-10 10:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205682, 450854, 46314, '<td valign="top">The lighting is not very flattering, and the conversion to b&amp;w doesn''t really hide the snapshot feel of the photo. The centred composition and high angle also don''t flatter much.</td>', 'The lighting is not very flattering, and the conversion to b&w doesn''t really hide the snapshot feel of the photo. The centred composition and high angle also don''t flatter much.', '2007-01-10 10:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205691, 450850, 60910, '<td valign="top">this is wonderful!</td>', 'this is wonderful!', '2007-01-10 10:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205692, 449449, 60910, '<td valign="top">nice!!</td>', 'nice!!', '2007-01-10 10:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205695, 447906, 46314, '<td valign="top">I''m not going to make a call on whether this shot meets the challenge or not (given that the challenge was for song TITLES, not lyrics). I''d rather just vote on the image itself. I think the use of a longer lens would have helped. The wide angle has distorted the lines, making the shot feel awkward to me. It distracts me from the real subject of the photo, which is the girl and her thoughts.</td>', 'I''m not going to make a call on whether this shot meets the challenge or not (given that the challenge was for song TITLES, not lyrics). I''d rather just vote on the image itself. I think the use of a longer lens would have helped. The wide angle has distorted the lines, making the shot feel awkward to me. It distracts me from the real subject of the photo, which is the girl and her thoughts.', '2007-01-10 10:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205696, 450495, 46314, '<td valign="top">Thank goodness you didn''t focus very well on the subject, nor light it very well.</td>', 'Thank goodness you didn''t focus very well on the subject, nor light it very well.', '2007-01-10 10:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205697, 449893, 70298, '<td valign="top">Good light, &amp; nicly taken</td>', 'Good light, & nicly taken', '2007-01-10 10:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205698, 450505, 46314, '<td valign="top">Very funny. Slightly longer DOF to get the eyes in focus would have made a stronger image.</td>', 'Very funny. Slightly longer DOF to get the eyes in focus would have made a stronger image.', '2007-01-10 10:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205699, 449929, 4747, '<td valign="top">Good concept, but a straight on shot lacks artistic interest, perhaps if you played around with different angles you could improve the shot</td>', 'Good concept, but a straight on shot lacks artistic interest, perhaps if you played around with different angles you could improve the shot', '2007-01-10 10:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205704, 449684, 46314, '<td valign="top">The globe is distracting. However, it is a very well taken shot. Good sharpness, nice clarity and colour.</td>', 'The globe is distracting. However, it is a very well taken shot. Good sharpness, nice clarity and colour.', '2007-01-10 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205708, 449604, 46314, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Not a very strong connection to the title though.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Not a very strong connection to the title though.', '2007-01-10 10:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205712, 450820, 46314, '<td valign="top">Clever way of representing this title.</td>', 'Clever way of representing this title.', '2007-01-10 10:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205713, 450495, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ummm...ewwww! <strike>Thanks</strike> for sharing.</td>', 'Ummm...ewwww! Thanks for sharing.', '2007-01-10 10:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205721, 449824, 4747, '<td valign="top">Great photo, but such a shame that the two humps in the foreground detract from it. Perhaps you could have cropped the image to remove them.</td>', 'Great photo, but such a shame that the two humps in the foreground detract from it. Perhaps you could have cropped the image to remove them.', '2007-01-10 11:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205730, 448253, 30049, '<td valign="top">You don''t have kids do you?  No way I''d 1) have time to put this together, and 2) keep it together with the kids around.  :D<br/> <br/>I could see this as a print.  Well put together.  Not sure if the voters will appreciate the "artistic" value of it...nonetheless, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'You don''t have kids do you?  No way I''d 1) have time to put this together, and 2) keep it together with the kids around.  :D I could see this as a print.  Well put together.  Not sure if the voters will appreciate the "artistic" value of it...nonetheless, good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-10 11:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205731, 449192, 4747, '<td valign="top">Poor little girl she looks feverish. I think if you had tried a different perspective... I.E. through the bars of her bed you may have come up with a more artistic image.</td>', 'Poor little girl she looks feverish. I think if you had tried a different perspective... I.E. through the bars of her bed you may have come up with a more artistic image.', '2007-01-10 11:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205732, 450043, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and the tone overall.  The eyes look to be hastily touched up.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the pose and the tone overall.  The eyes look to be hastily touched up.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-10 11:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205736, 449893, 26001, '<td valign="top">Excellent professional studio portait but it clearly emphasize "eyes" more than "lips". Altough this should get good score here because of the beautiful model :)</td>', 'Excellent professional studio portait but it clearly emphasize "eyes" more than "lips". Altough this should get good score here because of the beautiful model :)', '2007-01-10 11:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205742, 450844, 30049, '<td valign="top">So...were you in the rain also taking this photo, or comfortably warm in shelter?  :P  Very cool entry for the challenge.  Aggressive processing, but works well for this image.  Good luck.</td>', 'So...were you in the rain also taking this photo, or comfortably warm in shelter?  :P  Very cool entry for the challenge.  Aggressive processing, but works well for this image.  Good luck.', '2007-01-10 11:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3205745, 450505, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful POV for this photo.  Nice and crisp.  The DOF works well for the title.  Good luck.</td>', 'Wonderful POV for this photo.  Nice and crisp.  The DOF works well for the title.  Good luck.', '2007-01-10 11:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
