(3206610, 449815, 9237, '<td valign="top">I think this photo looks a little to ''homemade''. It is a great family album shot and I am a cat lover but the coloured claws add no sense of atmosphere and I fear they are perhaps a little pointless. The imposing black shadow on the right is also very eye distracting.</td>', 'I think this photo looks a little to ''homemade''. It is a great family album shot and I am a cat lover but the coloured claws add no sense of atmosphere and I fear they are perhaps a little pointless. The imposing black shadow on the right is also very eye distracting.', '2007-01-10 13:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
