(3206617, 449760, 28742, '<td valign="top">I wonder if you struggled with how close to crop in on this? I think if you had enough resolution in the image, you could have cropped in very close to show the detail on the cube and the liquid around it - the cup detracts a bit, IMO. The capture is fantastic though.</td>', 'I wonder if you struggled with how close to crop in on this? I think if you had enough resolution in the image, you could have cropped in very close to show the detail on the cube and the liquid around it - the cup detracts a bit, IMO. The capture is fantastic though.', '2007-01-10 13:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206631, 450731, 9237, '<td valign="top">This would have been a great shot had I believed the background blur was a result of a good photographer using the panning technique, however I think this Is the result of a blur effect in an editing piece of software, never the less, a good shot with some interesting effects applied - 6.</td>', 'This would have been a great shot had I believed the background blur was a result of a good photographer using the panning technique, however I think this Is the result of a blur effect in an editing piece of software, never the less, a good shot with some interesting effects applied - 6.', '2007-01-10 13:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
