(3206970, 450550, 71811, '<td valign="top">like the colors</td>', 'like the colors', '2007-01-10 14:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3206974, 448885, 47534, '<td valign="top">I agree that the woman pictured may have a ''sexyback'', however, there are many things that detract from this:<br/> <br/>(a)The harsh incandescent lighting casts an unhealthy glow to your subject''s skin, and is unflattering - please consider using the ''indoor'' or incandescent setting on your camera.  (b) Unless the young woman onscreen is also the person standing before the television, then the TV being on serves only as a distraction - try using a more bland background, with distance between it and your subject. (c)  The handgun is fine as a prop, but is too small and mostly goes unnoticed; maybe a ''portrait'' crop would work better  (d) PLEASE don''t stop trying!  I know that with just a little more work, this would look terrific - you have a great subject - win her over with your adoration!! ;)</td>', 'I agree that the woman pictured may have a ''sexyback'', however, there are many things that detract from this: (a)The harsh incandescent lighting casts an unhealthy glow to your subject''s skin, and is unflattering - please consider using the ''indoor'' or incandescent setting on your camera.  (b) Unless the young woman onscreen is also the person standing before the television, then the TV being on serves only as a distraction - try using a more bland background, with distance between it and your subject. (c)  The handgun is fine as a prop, but is too small and mostly goes unnoticed; maybe a ''portrait'' crop would work better  (d) PLEASE don''t stop trying!  I know that with just a little more work, this would look terrific - you have a great subject - win her over with your adoration!! ;)', '2007-01-10 14:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
