(3211394, 449449, 30049, '<td valign="top">Love the color tones in this and the POV.  Even the reflections on the panel are interesting.  One question - what''s up with the wide right border?  It''s a little distracting IMO.  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Love the color tones in this and the POV.  Even the reflections on the panel are interesting.  One question - what''s up with the wide right border?  It''s a little distracting IMO.  Overall, nicely done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-11 09:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
