(3211644, 450760, 46314, '<td valign="top">The tone is off. There are no real highlights in the photo. If you''d increased the exposure, or increased the strength of the lighting you would have gotten far more contrast that would have made the photo more appealing, rather than dark and drab.</td>', 'The tone is off. There are no real highlights in the photo. If you''d increased the exposure, or increased the strength of the lighting you would have gotten far more contrast that would have made the photo more appealing, rather than dark and drab.', '2007-01-11 10:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
