(3212487, 449638, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. I hate vignetting, but it''s kind of appropriate here. It helps hide the fact that you didn''t get a good background for this shot, which would have made this a contender. Still, what a great face and pose. 7</td>', 'Nice portrait. I hate vignetting, but it''s kind of appropriate here. It helps hide the fact that you didn''t get a good background for this shot, which would have made this a contender. Still, what a great face and pose. 7', '2007-01-11 13:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
