(3213381, 450839, 68586, '<td valign="top">Love the ''family portraits'' beautifully conceived and executed. However not so sure about the main character. If this is a progression through his life a slightly older, more worn look would have been more appropriate. As it is he (she) (it) simply seems surrounded by his own bodyparts. Nothing missing - simply displaced. Still worth a vote though :)</td>', 'Love the ''family portraits'' beautifully conceived and executed. However not so sure about the main character. If this is a progression through his life a slightly older, more worn look would have been more appropriate. As it is he (she) (it) simply seems surrounded by his own bodyparts. Nothing missing - simply displaced. Still worth a vote though :)', '2007-01-11 16:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
