(3213775, 450796, 46314, '<td valign="top">Quite a powerful portrayal of the title. The muted tones and hidden details of the face seem to complement it well - making the subject appear more like a victim.<br/>I don''t know if the landscape orientation really does it justice though. Still, it has interest, and makes you look at it more than once.</td>', 'Quite a powerful portrayal of the title. The muted tones and hidden details of the face seem to complement it well - making the subject appear more like a victim.I don''t know if the landscape orientation really does it justice though. Still, it has interest, and makes you look at it more than once.', '2007-01-11 17:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213778, 448327, 46314, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but wasn''t executed cleanly enough to make it a really stunning shot.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but wasn''t executed cleanly enough to make it a really stunning shot.', '2007-01-11 17:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213781, 449789, 46314, '<td valign="top">The first one I''ve seen using this title, without sugar in the shot...</td>', 'The first one I''ve seen using this title, without sugar in the shot...', '2007-01-11 17:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213788, 449764, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice strong lines and tones. Not sure if there is enough of a focal point though. Feels incomplete.</td>', 'Nice strong lines and tones. Not sure if there is enough of a focal point though. Feels incomplete.', '2007-01-11 17:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213793, 449973, 46314, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this ligthing must have been very appealing when you shot it, and you certainly brought out the colours well, but the the rest of the photo is too murky and dark, and it doesn''t really leave much of interest in the composition.</td>', 'I''m sure this ligthing must have been very appealing when you shot it, and you certainly brought out the colours well, but the the rest of the photo is too murky and dark, and it doesn''t really leave much of interest in the composition.', '2007-01-11 17:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213804, 448720, 46314, '<td valign="top">That looks like some lens flare in her hair. Maybe you intended it to make something of an angelic halo, but I think it detracts a bit from the portrait. Perhaps a soft focus/diffused light shot would have accomplished it better?</td>', 'That looks like some lens flare in her hair. Maybe you intended it to make something of an angelic halo, but I think it detracts a bit from the portrait. Perhaps a soft focus/diffused light shot would have accomplished it better?', '2007-01-11 17:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213807, 447233, 46314, '<td valign="top">Interesting angles.</td>', 'Interesting angles.', '2007-01-11 17:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213818, 448253, 43774, '<td valign="top">Great job!</td>', 'Great job!', '2007-01-11 17:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213819, 449893, 46314, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting and the clarity you achieved with this shot. Also, the make-up work on the model was superb. The only gripe I have is that her lips are partially covered and since they are the focus of the title, I feel that they seem a bit too unemphasised. Still, without the title, it''s an excellent portrait.</td>', 'I love the lighting and the clarity you achieved with this shot. Also, the make-up work on the model was superb. The only gripe I have is that her lips are partially covered and since they are the focus of the title, I feel that they seem a bit too unemphasised. Still, without the title, it''s an excellent portrait.', '2007-01-11 17:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213821, 449684, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice stup and lighting</td>', 'Nice stup and lighting', '2007-01-11 17:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213824, 450020, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very creative!</td>', 'Very creative!', '2007-01-11 17:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213826, 450541, 43774, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting in this, did you place them on a light box?</td>', 'Love the lighting in this, did you place them on a light box?', '2007-01-11 17:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213828, 450428, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very well done</td>', 'Very well done', '2007-01-11 17:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213829, 447996, 61062, '<td valign="top">great picture, models gaze fits the title perfectly</td>', 'great picture, models gaze fits the title perfectly', '2007-01-11 17:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213831, 448971, 46314, '<td valign="top">This feels like one of those macro shots where it''s not quite macro enough to be abstract, but not quite detailed enough to have a clear subject.</td>', 'This feels like one of those macro shots where it''s not quite macro enough to be abstract, but not quite detailed enough to have a clear subject.', '2007-01-11 17:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213834, 447317, 46314, '<td valign="top">I''m laughing. It certainly is a humorous choice of subject...</td>', 'I''m laughing. It certainly is a humorous choice of subject...', '2007-01-11 17:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213840, 450541, 46314, '<td valign="top">Clean focus and lighting, I just wish more colour had come through from those buttons.</td>', 'Clean focus and lighting, I just wish more colour had come through from those buttons.', '2007-01-11 17:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213842, 449670, 61062, '<td valign="top">great picture, would love to know how you got that effect</td>', 'great picture, would love to know how you got that effect', '2007-01-11 17:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213850, 450866, 46314, '<td valign="top">Ouch. I''m not a fan of computer screen art. I admire how you used the fibre optic cable to try make it more of a photo (at least I think that''s what you did).</td>', 'Ouch. I''m not a fan of computer screen art. I admire how you used the fibre optic cable to try make it more of a photo (at least I think that''s what you did).', '2007-01-11 17:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213851, 450020, 61062, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of this</td>', 'I love the idea of this', '2007-01-11 17:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213860, 448834, 46314, '<td valign="top">It''s a very neat image. Well shot - good focus, sharp lines. But it''s lacking any mood. Given the "heat" of the temperature, I think what would have made the photo stick out more is if you''d gone with a hot colour scheme, like bright reds and oranges as a backdrop for that yellow thermometer. Right now, the tones of the photo are just too cold to convey the feeling of temperature.</td>', 'It''s a very neat image. Well shot - good focus, sharp lines. But it''s lacking any mood. Given the "heat" of the temperature, I think what would have made the photo stick out more is if you''d gone with a hot colour scheme, like bright reds and oranges as a backdrop for that yellow thermometer. Right now, the tones of the photo are just too cold to convey the feeling of temperature.', '2007-01-11 17:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213867, 448916, 46314, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait. Really nice soft and bright lighting exhibit the model''s flawless features well. Perhaps a bit more colour in the lips would have complimented the title better, but that''s just a minor point.</td>', 'Lovely portrait. Really nice soft and bright lighting exhibit the model''s flawless features well. Perhaps a bit more colour in the lips would have complimented the title better, but that''s just a minor point.', '2007-01-11 17:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213880, 450527, 46314, '<td valign="top">Somebody else did a close-up of a thermometer and my comment to them would apply to yours too. It''s a very neat, well taken shot. Clean lines, good focus. Your composition is strong too. But the one thing lacking are complementary colour tones. Right now you have a good stock photo for thermometers. But imagine how much more evocative the picture would have been if you''d gone with a cold colour scheme (blues/purple) and a cold temperature on the display, or a warm colour scheme (reds/oranges) and a hot temperature reading? Just a thought. Still a good shot.</td>', 'Somebody else did a close-up of a thermometer and my comment to them would apply to yours too. It''s a very neat, well taken shot. Clean lines, good focus. Your composition is strong too. But the one thing lacking are complementary colour tones. Right now you have a good stock photo for thermometers. But imagine how much more evocative the picture would have been if you''d gone with a cold colour scheme (blues/purple) and a cold temperature on the display, or a warm colour scheme (reds/oranges) and a hot temperature reading? Just a thought. Still a good shot.', '2007-01-11 17:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213897, 448918, 46314, '<td valign="top">Very pretty animal. I did a dog shot a few entries ago, and I know how difficult it is to get them to give you a ribbon winning pose. But unfortunately (as I had in mine), I don''t quite think this is that winning pose - it doesn''t really draw me into the photo, since the dog doesn''t really connect with the camera/viewer. Still, it''s a nice shot of a great subject.</td>', 'Very pretty animal. I did a dog shot a few entries ago, and I know how difficult it is to get them to give you a ribbon winning pose. But unfortunately (as I had in mine), I don''t quite think this is that winning pose - it doesn''t really draw me into the photo, since the dog doesn''t really connect with the camera/viewer. Still, it''s a nice shot of a great subject.', '2007-01-11 17:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213901, 450611, 46314, '<td valign="top">Clever way to portray the title. The colour cast is a bit off-putting though (too yellow), and overall the photo could have been a bit sharper.</td>', 'Clever way to portray the title. The colour cast is a bit off-putting though (too yellow), and overall the photo could have been a bit sharper.', '2007-01-11 17:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213912, 450796, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot. I think it meets the challenge very well in a dark sort of way. 7</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot. I think it meets the challenge very well in a dark sort of way. 7', '2007-01-11 17:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213915, 447687, 46314, '<td valign="top">Ha! I''ve been waiting for someone to use elevators for this title. I love it. It''s a pity the light falls off a bit on the right, but you processed the b&amp;w well - nice tones from light to dark. And the portrait orientation compliments the vertical lines of the elevator shafts well. Also, but having one compartment at the bottom, you nailed the link into the title. Well done.</td>', 'Ha! I''ve been waiting for someone to use elevators for this title. I love it. It''s a pity the light falls off a bit on the right, but you processed the b&w well - nice tones from light to dark. And the portrait orientation compliments the vertical lines of the elevator shafts well. Also, but having one compartment at the bottom, you nailed the link into the title. Well done.', '2007-01-11 17:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213918, 449139, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice use of perspective to convey the title, and the leading lines of the car tires make for a very good composition.</td>', 'Nice use of perspective to convey the title, and the leading lines of the car tires make for a very good composition.', '2007-01-11 17:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213923, 448846, 46314, '<td valign="top">Very strong composition, and a bold use of lighting. Still trying to decide whether I like how the head and hand have been disembodied by blending the torso into the background. I have a feeling that it might have put more weight behind that pointing gesture if there''d been a torso behind it.</td>', 'Very strong composition, and a bold use of lighting. Still trying to decide whether I like how the head and hand have been disembodied by blending the torso into the background. I have a feeling that it might have put more weight behind that pointing gesture if there''d been a torso behind it.', '2007-01-11 17:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213924, 450438, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The lighting is perhaps a bit flat, but I think you executed your idea very well. Good work.</td>', 'Nicely done. The lighting is perhaps a bit flat, but I think you executed your idea very well. Good work.', '2007-01-11 17:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213930, 449449, 46314, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot of this impressive vehicle. I like the dramatic angle, and the muted tones and dark burning in give it a real hard-core attitude. Well done.</td>', 'Lovely shot of this impressive vehicle. I like the dramatic angle, and the muted tones and dark burning in give it a real hard-core attitude. Well done.', '2007-01-11 17:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213931, 450785, 23484, '<td valign="top">You certainly couldn''t have achieved  better focus considering the DOF is so shallow. This one is more tasteful that many of the others. 7</td>', 'You certainly couldn''t have achieved  better focus considering the DOF is so shallow. This one is more tasteful that many of the others. 7', '2007-01-11 17:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213933, 450800, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I really love the contrast. 7</td>', 'Great shot. I really love the contrast. 7', '2007-01-11 17:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213939, 447474, 46314, '<td valign="top">I like the ''through the button'' lighting, but I think you could have done more with the arrangement of the buttons to mimic the pattern/create more visual interest. Also I think the yellow colour cast detracts from what could be interesting colours on the buttons.</td>', 'I like the ''through the button'' lighting, but I think you could have done more with the arrangement of the buttons to mimic the pattern/create more visual interest. Also I think the yellow colour cast detracts from what could be interesting colours on the buttons.', '2007-01-11 18:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213941, 449893, 23484, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of this shot.  I think this is the best of the "Lips of an Angel" shot. 7</td>', 'I like the softness of this shot.  I think this is the best of the "Lips of an Angel" shot. 7', '2007-01-11 18:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213943, 450391, 23484, '<td valign="top">This kind of has that "X-Files" kind of look to it. Great job with the lighting. 7</td>', 'This kind of has that "X-Files" kind of look to it. Great job with the lighting. 7', '2007-01-11 18:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213944, 450020, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and use of selective colour. But somehow the colours inside the photo seem overprocessed, and not ''natural'' at all.</td>', 'Nice idea and use of selective colour. But somehow the colours inside the photo seem overprocessed, and not ''natural'' at all.', '2007-01-11 18:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213948, 450553, 46314, '<td valign="top">Not a very interesting photograph. Need to get a more visually interesting angle on the subject, and also use less of that dead black space.</td>', 'Not a very interesting photograph. Need to get a more visually interesting angle on the subject, and also use less of that dead black space.', '2007-01-11 18:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213952, 450216, 46314, '<td valign="top">Would make a nice stock photo. Has a clean and simple colour scheme. Not a ribbon winner, but a competent effort.</td>', 'Would make a nice stock photo. Has a clean and simple colour scheme. Not a ribbon winner, but a competent effort.', '2007-01-11 18:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213959, 448914, 46314, '<td valign="top">Lovely landscape shot. That strong leading diagonal pulls you right into the photo and across the bridge. Good DOF and nice sharpness. The tone is spot on too, with a nice range from that strong black of the bridge to the light horizon.</td>', 'Lovely landscape shot. That strong leading diagonal pulls you right into the photo and across the bridge. Good DOF and nice sharpness. The tone is spot on too, with a nice range from that strong black of the bridge to the light horizon.', '2007-01-11 18:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213964, 449925, 46314, '<td valign="top">A very well set-up shot. I love how strong the form of the subject is, despite all the details being lost to the haze of the water. Very well executed.</td>', 'A very well set-up shot. I love how strong the form of the subject is, despite all the details being lost to the haze of the water. Very well executed.', '2007-01-11 18:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213967, 450827, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice use of colour, and I love how you''ve gotten the hair to look like a flame on her head. Great lighting.</td>', 'Nice use of colour, and I love how you''ve gotten the hair to look like a flame on her head. Great lighting.', '2007-01-11 18:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213981, 448696, 46314, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful shot, although I don''t think the the centred composition carries the title as well. If the horizon was higher, the eye would have had to travel farther across the water to get to the point of interest (the bright island), and that might have conveyed the title better. Still, it''d make a great print that I''d be proud to have on my wall... Have you tried a square crop?</td>', 'Very beautiful shot, although I don''t think the the centred composition carries the title as well. If the horizon was higher, the eye would have had to travel farther across the water to get to the point of interest (the bright island), and that might have conveyed the title better. Still, it''d make a great print that I''d be proud to have on my wall... Have you tried a square crop?', '2007-01-11 18:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213983, 448236, 46314, '<td valign="top">Funny - good pose. The distorted wide angle compliments it well.</td>', 'Funny - good pose. The distorted wide angle compliments it well.', '2007-01-11 18:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3213986, 447634, 46314, '<td valign="top">Erm, yeah, there''s not much to see here...</td>', 'Erm, yeah, there''s not much to see here...', '2007-01-11 18:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214094, 450848, 49926, '<td valign="top">Very cool!</td>', 'Very cool!', '2007-01-11 18:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214190, 449703, 29513, '<td valign="top">If I were going to change anything it might be to increase contrast a little bit.  Beautiful.  7.</td>', 'If I were going to change anything it might be to increase contrast a little bit.  Beautiful.  7.', '2007-01-11 19:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214197, 450803, 29513, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and I like the presentation of the model.  Now if you had a dark background and a bit more contrast. . . 6.</td>', 'Nice composition and I like the presentation of the model.  Now if you had a dark background and a bit more contrast. . . 6.', '2007-01-11 19:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214199, 448975, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like the effect and a good job on the exposure of the moon.  7.</td>', 'I like the effect and a good job on the exposure of the moon.  7.', '2007-01-11 19:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214204, 449180, 29513, '<td valign="top">I think I might have tried moving the guys off center some.</td>', 'I think I might have tried moving the guys off center some.', '2007-01-11 19:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214210, 449903, 29513, '<td valign="top">I really like the dark background and the high contrast.  I would like to have seen it in color, though.</td>', 'I really like the dark background and the high contrast.  I would like to have seen it in color, though.', '2007-01-11 19:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214218, 450796, 29513, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  You have an unflinching eye and that leads to something profound. 10.</td>', 'Nicely done.  You have an unflinching eye and that leads to something profound. 10.', '2007-01-11 19:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214220, 449976, 33672, '<td valign="top">Very thought provoking. I don''t know. Nice POV, Nice wide angle, great shadows and sky. Background subject seems like a cardboard cut out (Probably the lens). Perhaps if he were closer it would eliminate this, but the subject''s knee in the foreground seems to suffer from the same effect....</td>', 'Very thought provoking. I don''t know. Nice POV, Nice wide angle, great shadows and sky. Background subject seems like a cardboard cut out (Probably the lens). Perhaps if he were closer it would eliminate this, but the subject''s knee in the foreground seems to suffer from the same effect....', '2007-01-11 19:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214223, 450070, 33672, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones and capture.</td>', 'Very nice tones and capture.', '2007-01-11 19:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214224, 450196, 71664, '<td valign="top">interesting. try to get all the numbers facing the camera so that none of them are blurry.</td>', 'interesting. try to get all the numbers facing the camera so that none of them are blurry.', '2007-01-11 19:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214228, 448236, 71664, '<td valign="top">get a better subject with better expression.  dont have the outer edges black.</td>', 'get a better subject with better expression.  dont have the outer edges black.', '2007-01-11 19:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214229, 450550, 33672, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful location. Nice capture. I really like the color contrast between theblue sky and orange light of the tent.</td>', 'What a beautiful location. Nice capture. I really like the color contrast between theblue sky and orange light of the tent.', '2007-01-11 19:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
