(3214237, 448327, 71664, '<td valign="top">neat concept.  WB seems off.  i would like it better if the only ink in the water was just comming out of the pen and at the bottom of the glass.</td>', 'neat concept.  WB seems off.  i would like it better if the only ink in the water was just comming out of the pen and at the bottom of the glass.', '2007-01-11 19:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
