(3214490, 447653, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok, I get the ''Over my Head'' part, but why the "(contrast)"?  The photo speaks pretty well for itself.  Anyway...I like the feel of this, it''s symmetrical in an abstract way if that makes any sense.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Ok, I get the ''Over my Head'' part, but why the "(contrast)"?  The photo speaks pretty well for itself.  Anyway...I like the feel of this, it''s symmetrical in an abstract way if that makes any sense.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-11 20:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
