(3214494, 448885, 30049, '<td valign="top">This feels kind of like an afterthought, or "honey, don''t move...let me get the camera".  It''s the TV image I think that''s giving it that feel IMO.  The primary subject, the "back" isn''t quite in focus.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This feels kind of like an afterthought, or "honey, don''t move...let me get the camera".  It''s the TV image I think that''s giving it that feel IMO.  The primary subject, the "back" isn''t quite in focus.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-11 20:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
