(3214656, 448281, 69407, '<td valign="top">This photo causes a lot of unease! Not entirely sure if the focus is supposed to be the lady or the hotdogs... or is she angry about the hot dogs? Little confused, but you captured the tension very well!</td>', 'This photo causes a lot of unease! Not entirely sure if the focus is supposed to be the lady or the hotdogs... or is she angry about the hot dogs? Little confused, but you captured the tension very well!', '2007-01-11 21:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214660, 447634, 69407, '<td valign="top">I''m not entirely sure what I''m looking at... but I think it''s a silhouette? Could have been a little more distinct, but I love the idea!</td>', 'I''m not entirely sure what I''m looking at... but I think it''s a silhouette? Could have been a little more distinct, but I love the idea!', '2007-01-11 21:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214678, 449443, 29513, '<td valign="top">A dark background might have brought out the colors more.</td>', 'A dark background might have brought out the colors more.', '2007-01-11 21:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214685, 450807, 60009, '<td valign="top">The space in the bottom right is distracting, pulls my eye away from the subject.  I''d try cropping of the right side up to the tear in the bag.</td>', 'The space in the bottom right is distracting, pulls my eye away from the subject.  I''d try cropping of the right side up to the tear in the bag.', '2007-01-11 21:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214690, 448975, 69407, '<td valign="top">The centered moon and the warm colors (fire) make for a really interesting composition. I think you''re going for a lesser-used meaning of ''promiscuous'' here?</td>', 'The centered moon and the warm colors (fire) make for a really interesting composition. I think you''re going for a lesser-used meaning of ''promiscuous'' here?', '2007-01-11 21:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214695, 450686, 29513, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  Increasing the contrast just a touch may have made it a bit crisper.  Seems a little mushy.  Great colors, though.  7.</td>', 'Great colors.  Increasing the contrast just a touch may have made it a bit crisper.  Seems a little mushy.  Great colors, though.  7.', '2007-01-11 21:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214714, 450827, 29513, '<td valign="top">Great job!  It takes some creativity to do the temperature thing without any numbers and you did it.  Great colors and good contrast.  10.</td>', 'Great job!  It takes some creativity to do the temperature thing without any numbers and you did it.  Great colors and good contrast.  10.', '2007-01-11 21:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3214726, 449899, 29513, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and the range of values you got in the background.  I also like that the model is on the "light" side gazing over toward the "dark" side.  Simple and elegant and cute.  I would like to see the model be a little bigger in the frame, maybe.  6.</td>', 'I like the colors and the range of values you got in the background.  I also like that the model is on the "light" side gazing over toward the "dark" side.  Simple and elegant and cute.  I would like to see the model be a little bigger in the frame, maybe.  6.', '2007-01-11 21:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
