(3216233, 450608, 49305, '<td valign="top">i absolutley love the color in this photo !</td>', 'i absolutley love the color in this photo !', '2007-01-12 01:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216237, 449638, 49305, '<td valign="top">love the concept.</td>', 'love the concept.', '2007-01-12 01:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216706, 450566, 46314, '<td valign="top">Anytime you try to capture writing on paper, the shot becomes more difficult, but I think you handled the composition very well here. The only thing I don''t really like is the red colour cast, but maybe you did that to get the colours on her sweater to blend in more, rather than be distracting. I just think a nice vivid white page would bring out the wilted and faded rose more.</td>', 'Anytime you try to capture writing on paper, the shot becomes more difficult, but I think you handled the composition very well here. The only thing I don''t really like is the red colour cast, but maybe you did that to get the colours on her sweater to blend in more, rather than be distracting. I just think a nice vivid white page would bring out the wilted and faded rose more.', '2007-01-12 04:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216710, 450243, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but the composition is a bit flawed. There doesn''t seem to be enough balance between the man and dog. Perhaps the dog shouldn''t be in the frame at all. And also the red pants in the background are a bit distracting. Had those elements been resolved, I think you would have had quite an energetic and captivating image.</td>', 'Nice capture, but the composition is a bit flawed. There doesn''t seem to be enough balance between the man and dog. Perhaps the dog shouldn''t be in the frame at all. And also the red pants in the background are a bit distracting. Had those elements been resolved, I think you would have had quite an energetic and captivating image.', '2007-01-12 04:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216712, 450551, 46314, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a lot of noise in this pic (little pixels of colour in the ice. Perhaps you need to lower your ISO a bit when shooting to ensure the images are cleaner.</td>', 'There seems to be a lot of noise in this pic (little pixels of colour in the ice. Perhaps you need to lower your ISO a bit when shooting to ensure the images are cleaner.', '2007-01-12 04:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216717, 450861, 46314, '<td valign="top">Well executed, but the composition doesn''t seem interesting enough. I think you could have created more of a montage. Like maybe a "MISSING: Steve Davidson" poster in the background, and some red marker on the map - indicating a search in progress. That would have tied into the title better, and made a more dramatic photo.</td>', 'Well executed, but the composition doesn''t seem interesting enough. I think you could have created more of a montage. Like maybe a "MISSING: Steve Davidson" poster in the background, and some red marker on the map - indicating a search in progress. That would have tied into the title better, and made a more dramatic photo.', '2007-01-12 04:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216720, 450503, 46314, '<td valign="top">That Booty doesn''t look new... it''s all dirty ;-) Nice use of the lighting for emphasis.</td>', 'That Booty doesn''t look new... it''s all dirty ;-) Nice use of the lighting for emphasis.', '2007-01-12 04:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216723, 450514, 46314, '<td valign="top">Quite noisy. Did you overprocess the sharpening, or is that camera noise from a high ISO? Also, the subjects get a bit lost in the complicated background.</td>', 'Quite noisy. Did you overprocess the sharpening, or is that camera noise from a high ISO? Also, the subjects get a bit lost in the complicated background.', '2007-01-12 04:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216726, 450828, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice colours. Everyone else who has used this idea used such dull colour buttons. Yours pop more.</td>', 'Nice colours. Everyone else who has used this idea used such dull colour buttons. Yours pop more.', '2007-01-12 04:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216730, 449976, 46314, '<td valign="top">Yeah, crazy indeed. Reminds me of a scene from the Jackass movie. I like how the distorted lens gives us a feel of what his vision must look like, but the shot seems a bit overprocessed, and everyone looks a bit too relaxed to convey the more kinetic emotion of ''craziness''.</td>', 'Yeah, crazy indeed. Reminds me of a scene from the Jackass movie. I like how the distorted lens gives us a feel of what his vision must look like, but the shot seems a bit overprocessed, and everyone looks a bit too relaxed to convey the more kinetic emotion of ''craziness''.', '2007-01-12 04:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216732, 450605, 46314, '<td valign="top">The composition doesn''t allow the shoes to really dominate. I think it is an idea that had enormous potential, but it just wasn''t executed well enough.</td>', 'The composition doesn''t allow the shoes to really dominate. I think it is an idea that had enormous potential, but it just wasn''t executed well enough.', '2007-01-12 04:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216737, 449899, 46314, '<td valign="top">Lighting isn''t my favourite. I know you were probably going for the blown out highlights on top (reminds me of one of those idea lightbulbs popping up over someone''s head), but the lighting on the face seems too dark. You could have cropped off the left half though - it doesn''t really add to the image.</td>', 'Lighting isn''t my favourite. I know you were probably going for the blown out highlights on top (reminds me of one of those idea lightbulbs popping up over someone''s head), but the lighting on the face seems too dark. You could have cropped off the left half though - it doesn''t really add to the image.', '2007-01-12 04:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216743, 448571, 46314, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem to tie into the title at all (unless that is in fact Nick Lachey...). And other than that, it''s just a bland portrait with flat lighting.</td>', 'Doesn''t seem to tie into the title at all (unless that is in fact Nick Lachey...). And other than that, it''s just a bland portrait with flat lighting.', '2007-01-12 04:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216750, 449866, 33352, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a signiture in this very emotive image to fit the song,sandyP this looks very you, hope I am right...</td>', 'There seems to be a signiture in this very emotive image to fit the song,sandyP this looks very you, hope I am right...', '2007-01-12 04:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216753, 450868, 33352, '<td valign="top">Very well done ... good processing...</td>', 'Very well done ... good processing...', '2007-01-12 04:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216761, 450780, 46314, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the shadow to make this a more interesting shot. Otherwise it would have just been a good product shot (like on eBay). I think it might have even had more impact if you hadn''t included the wall''s shadow, so that the background was all white, giving more emphasis the statue itself. But the way it is, it has a nice ying-yang feel. The sharpness of the shadow on the wall is very well done.</td>', 'I like the use of the shadow to make this a more interesting shot. Otherwise it would have just been a good product shot (like on eBay). I think it might have even had more impact if you hadn''t included the wall''s shadow, so that the background was all white, giving more emphasis the statue itself. But the way it is, it has a nice ying-yang feel. The sharpness of the shadow on the wall is very well done.', '2007-01-12 04:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216765, 447996, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice straight-jacket. Good pose... she looks scary crazy.</td>', 'Nice straight-jacket. Good pose... she looks scary crazy.', '2007-01-12 04:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216769, 450300, 46314, '<td valign="top">Very nice silhouettes, and great sharpness. Doesn''t seem to be the best tie-in to the title, although I guess the sun is pretty far away...</td>', 'Very nice silhouettes, and great sharpness. Doesn''t seem to be the best tie-in to the title, although I guess the sun is pretty far away...', '2007-01-12 04:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216807, 449824, 46314, '<td valign="top">She is beautiful and you captured a nice swimsuit shot. I think the boulders in the foreground are a bit distracting though.</td>', 'She is beautiful and you captured a nice swimsuit shot. I think the boulders in the foreground are a bit distracting though.', '2007-01-12 05:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216811, 448253, 46314, '<td valign="top">The overhead angle is neat - and everything is quite sharp. I also like the colour and arrangement of the buttons. But, it doesn''t really make much connection to me as the viewer. It''s just a shot of well, buttons...</td>', 'The overhead angle is neat - and everything is quite sharp. I also like the colour and arrangement of the buttons. But, it doesn''t really make much connection to me as the viewer. It''s just a shot of well, buttons...', '2007-01-12 05:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216813, 449854, 46314, '<td valign="top">Not well composed, and either the focus is off, or there was a bit of camera shake from a handheld night shot.</td>', 'Not well composed, and either the focus is off, or there was a bit of camera shake from a handheld night shot.', '2007-01-12 05:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216822, 450836, 46314, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the composition that much, but i do like the way the curve of the road directs your eye to the person, and I really like the miniature person. Amazing how much detail is lost on the person, yet the walking is still conveyed...</td>', 'I don''t like the composition that much, but i do like the way the curve of the road directs your eye to the person, and I really like the miniature person. Amazing how much detail is lost on the person, yet the walking is still conveyed...', '2007-01-12 05:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216827, 450428, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice idea to link to the title. The shot is quite neat. I like the lines of colour. A bit of noise though - perhaps smoother tones might have made it more striking.</td>', 'Nice idea to link to the title. The shot is quite neat. I like the lines of colour. A bit of noise though - perhaps smoother tones might have made it more striking.', '2007-01-12 05:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
