(3216835, 449693, 46314, '<td valign="top">OMG - where are her legs! Oh, the must just be lost under that dress. I dunno, the dark background with the pink dress and angelic face just don''t work for me. Needed to be more high-key maybe.</td>', 'OMG - where are her legs! Oh, the must just be lost under that dress. I dunno, the dark background with the pink dress and angelic face just don''t work for me. Needed to be more high-key maybe.', '2007-01-12 05:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216839, 449180, 46314, '<td valign="top">Cool, Reservoir Cops... The dark shapes of their bodies get a bit lost in the dark patches in the cars in the background. Those cars probably weren''t necessary - they clutter the shot, and from the uniforms, we can understand that they are police.</td>', 'Cool, Reservoir Cops... The dark shapes of their bodies get a bit lost in the dark patches in the cars in the background. Those cars probably weren''t necessary - they clutter the shot, and from the uniforms, we can understand that they are police.', '2007-01-12 05:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216841, 447644, 46314, '<td valign="top">I dunno - you chopped of that side of the photo, so I can''t really tell what''s left of you... I''m not sure how this relates to the title. Is it the contrast between his wild hairstyle, and the business suit? If so, a tie might have made the contrast more apparent. Now he just looks like a Calvin Klein model. Very well taken though.</td>', 'I dunno - you chopped of that side of the photo, so I can''t really tell what''s left of you... I''m not sure how this relates to the title. Is it the contrast between his wild hairstyle, and the business suit? If so, a tie might have made the contrast more apparent. Now he just looks like a Calvin Klein model. Very well taken though.', '2007-01-12 05:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
