(3216978, 450462, 71239, '<td valign="top">This image has stunning landscape, excellent placement of the model and absolutely meets the challenge criteria.  It is so sad that I have to mark it way down for being underexposed by 2 stops, otherwise it''s an easy 8-10.</td>', 'This image has stunning landscape, excellent placement of the model and absolutely meets the challenge criteria.  It is so sad that I have to mark it way down for being underexposed by 2 stops, otherwise it''s an easy 8-10.', '2007-01-12 06:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216982, 450855, 46314, '<td valign="top">The selective colour was a clever way to highlight the fallen fruit.</td>', 'The selective colour was a clever way to highlight the fallen fruit.', '2007-01-12 06:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216986, 448811, 46314, '<td valign="top">I want one of those toys. I loved that movie. The lighting is a bit dull though. Would have liked to have seen more of the threatening robot behind it. Also, I don''t think the green colour cast really helps the photo.</td>', 'I want one of those toys. I loved that movie. The lighting is a bit dull though. Would have liked to have seen more of the threatening robot behind it. Also, I don''t think the green colour cast really helps the photo.', '2007-01-12 06:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216990, 448172, 46314, '<td valign="top">She looks more helpless than crazy... Maybe wild eyes would have conveyed the idea of crazy better than blindfolded. Nicely shot though.</td>', 'She looks more helpless than crazy... Maybe wild eyes would have conveyed the idea of crazy better than blindfolded. Nicely shot though.', '2007-01-12 06:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216994, 449866, 71239, '<td valign="top">*Great* lighting, fantastic expressions, creamy background and some post-processing that enhances the dreamy quality of the image.  Almost impossible combination when working with animals.  Straight 10!</td>', '*Great* lighting, fantastic expressions, creamy background and some post-processing that enhances the dreamy quality of the image.  Almost impossible combination when working with animals.  Straight 10!', '2007-01-12 06:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3216998, 450632, 46314, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve done this. Other people simply had big sins on paper, but here you''ve used imagery to allude to the sinfulness being writting. Clever. Although the composition could be improved to make it a stronger image (that dead black space in the top left seems to unbalance the image).</td>', 'I like the way you''ve done this. Other people simply had big sins on paper, but here you''ve used imagery to allude to the sinfulness being writting. Clever. Although the composition could be improved to make it a stronger image (that dead black space in the top left seems to unbalance the image).', '2007-01-12 06:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3217002, 449180, 71239, '<td valign="top">Works very well in black &amp; white.  Didn''t the guy on the left appear in Terminator2? :-)</td>', 'Works very well in black & white.  Didn''t the guy on the left appear in Terminator2? :-)', '2007-01-12 06:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3217005, 447473, 46314, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a bit off - could be minute camera shake. Might have been helped by some more aggressive sharpening. That said, I like the subdued lighting and green colours, and the white moving water creates a little interest in the photo.</td>', 'The focus seems a bit off - could be minute camera shake. Might have been helped by some more aggressive sharpening. That said, I like the subdued lighting and green colours, and the white moving water creates a little interest in the photo.', '2007-01-12 06:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3217012, 447911, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice jeans. Don''t find the photo all that interesting though.</td>', 'Nice jeans. Don''t find the photo all that interesting though.', '2007-01-12 07:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3217016, 450865, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp silhouettes. Could have bumped up the contrast a little to make them more prominent maybe.</td>', 'Nice sharp silhouettes. Could have bumped up the contrast a little to make them more prominent maybe.', '2007-01-12 07:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3217021, 450780, 49109, '<td valign="top">would have been nice to take a photograph only of the shadow</td>', 'would have been nice to take a photograph only of the shadow', '2007-01-12 07:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3217032, 450462, 46314, '<td valign="top">Way too dark. Needed to get that white snow WHITE, so that we could see the figure walking away. Did you perhaps edit it on an extremely bright monitor? It seems (from what I can make out) to be nicely composed with a nice S-curver road leading your eye through the image. But the image is just too dark to give it a decent score.</td>', 'Way too dark. Needed to get that white snow WHITE, so that we could see the figure walking away. Did you perhaps edit it on an extremely bright monitor? It seems (from what I can make out) to be nicely composed with a nice S-curver road leading your eye through the image. But the image is just too dark to give it a decent score.', '2007-01-12 07:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3217035, 449555, 46314, '<td valign="top">Not sharp enough, not bright enough (would have liked more contrast) and quite noisy.</td>', 'Not sharp enough, not bright enough (would have liked more contrast) and quite noisy.', '2007-01-12 07:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3217039, 450796, 49109, '<td valign="top">great shot, perfect props, lighting and composition, well post-processed - a winner in my book!</td>', 'great shot, perfect props, lighting and composition, well post-processed - a winner in my book!', '2007-01-12 07:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
