(3220610, 448914, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting on this, and I commend you for holding back on over burning the sky as many would be tempted to do with that cloud formation.  It''s nice that you have a distant tree line to use as a horizon so others won''t think that it''s tilted (bridge and foreground trees lend to a tilt feel).  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice lighting on this, and I commend you for holding back on over burning the sky as many would be tempted to do with that cloud formation.  It''s nice that you have a distant tree line to use as a horizon so others won''t think that it''s tilted (bridge and foreground trees lend to a tilt feel).  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-12 15:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
