(3222006, 449760, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hey.  I just saw one of these a minute ago.  :D  Their''s was a big splash, yours is a little splash.  Hmmm.  I think with the smaller splash you''re losing some impact with all of the surrounding distractions.  I would have cropped this in substantially and shown off that nice arc on the left side of the splash.  The coffee cup is dirty - from prior attempts maybe?  All JMO of course.  :P  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hey.  I just saw one of these a minute ago.  :D  Their''s was a big splash, yours is a little splash.  Hmmm.  I think with the smaller splash you''re losing some impact with all of the surrounding distractions.  I would have cropped this in substantially and shown off that nice arc on the left side of the splash.  The coffee cup is dirty - from prior attempts maybe?  All JMO of course.  :P  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-01-12 19:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
