(3227085, 449929, 29513, '<td valign="top">Technically, this is pretty good if, perhaps, a bit trite.  I would like a darker background, though, to contrast with the skin tone.  I think the dark background would show off your good use of depth of field, too, as the arms and upper back tend to blend in with the light background.</td>', 'Technically, this is pretty good if, perhaps, a bit trite.  I would like a darker background, though, to contrast with the skin tone.  I think the dark background would show off your good use of depth of field, too, as the arms and upper back tend to blend in with the light background.', '2007-01-13 18:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3227090, 449719, 24454, '<td valign="top">Beeeeeautiful!   This is so "my" kind of photo!   I love the perspective.  The colors.  The barrenness.   Fantastic job!</td>', 'Beeeeeautiful!   This is so "my" kind of photo!   I love the perspective.  The colors.  The barrenness.   Fantastic job!', '2007-01-13 18:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
