(3229224, 447061, 62095, '<td valign="top">I wonder how many comments you have saying that this is too small? I''m guessing more than 10. It''s a bit small.  There''s a good tutorial on resizing images in the Learn - tutorials menu of this site.  Is it a mobile phone image?  <br/> <br/>Aside from it being too small, I guess improvements that you could look at are -<br/> <br/>Framing - dead centre subject lack energy. <br/>Background / composition - pretty cluttered, distracts from your subject<br/>Subject - not really prominant enough, the woman is tiny really.<br/> <br/>Keep entering.</td>', 'I wonder how many comments you have saying that this is too small? I''m guessing more than 10. It''s a bit small.  There''s a good tutorial on resizing images in the Learn - tutorials menu of this site.  Is it a mobile phone image?   Aside from it being too small, I guess improvements that you could look at are - Framing - dead centre subject lack energy. Background / composition - pretty cluttered, distracts from your subjectSubject - not really prominant enough, the woman is tiny really. Keep entering.', '2007-01-14 08:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
