(3234755, 448885, 46314, '<td valign="top">Well, it met the challenge - the title fits. But it''s a poor photo. The background is horribly distracting, and appears to have no relevance to the photo (would have been interesting if that had been Justin Timberlake on screen). The white balance is off, so the skin''s all orange (not that white balance would be easy with a TV in the background). And it''s not quite sharp, which I suspect is from a slow shutter speed or camera shake. If you''ve got willing models, that''s always half the battle won. Try harder next time.</td>', 'Well, it met the challenge - the title fits. But it''s a poor photo. The background is horribly distracting, and appears to have no relevance to the photo (would have been interesting if that had been Justin Timberlake on screen). The white balance is off, so the skin''s all orange (not that white balance would be easy with a TV in the background). And it''s not quite sharp, which I suspect is from a slow shutter speed or camera shake. If you''ve got willing models, that''s always half the battle won. Try harder next time.', '2007-01-15 13:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3234766, 448758, 46314, '<td valign="top">I like how the green colour cast adds to the ''sickness''. Nice composition. It''s not quite as sharp as it can be, to capture the details better at this close range. Still, nice entry.</td>', 'I like how the green colour cast adds to the ''sickness''. Nice composition. It''s not quite as sharp as it can be, to capture the details better at this close range. Still, nice entry.', '2007-01-15 13:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
