(3235085, 450514, 66952, '<td valign="top">A good idea, ducks running the rapids. However, it is way oversharpened, and some of the noise got sharpened, so it looks noisy, too. You might go to the forums and search for threads on noise reduction and sharpening.</td>', 'A good idea, ducks running the rapids. However, it is way oversharpened, and some of the noise got sharpened, so it looks noisy, too. You might go to the forums and search for threads on noise reduction and sharpening.', '2007-01-15 13:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235097, 450183, 46314, '<td valign="top">Reasonably sharp, and bold colours. Lighting was well handled. Competent entry.</td>', 'Reasonably sharp, and bold colours. Lighting was well handled. Competent entry.', '2007-01-15 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235111, 449690, 46314, '<td valign="top">Strong metaphor, but too many petals detract from the main decaying flower. Maybe by separating them on different planes, like having the main flower set above the other fallen petals, taken from a higher angle. That way the other petals would have blurred outside the DOF, or woud have been darker without the main lighting.</td>', 'Strong metaphor, but too many petals detract from the main decaying flower. Maybe by separating them on different planes, like having the main flower set above the other fallen petals, taken from a higher angle. That way the other petals would have blurred outside the DOF, or woud have been darker without the main lighting.', '2007-01-15 14:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235136, 449626, 46314, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape. Reminds me of the Highveld in South Africa. Open plains, stark Acacia trees. The composition is very strong, and I like the contrast between the yellow land and blue skies. Just enough clouds to make the sky interesting. Good entry.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape. Reminds me of the Highveld in South Africa. Open plains, stark Acacia trees. The composition is very strong, and I like the contrast between the yellow land and blue skies. Just enough clouds to make the sky interesting. Good entry.', '2007-01-15 14:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235141, 448609, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice stark lighting, and I like the desaturated colours. Really adds to the haunted look in her face.</td>', 'Nice stark lighting, and I like the desaturated colours. Really adds to the haunted look in her face.', '2007-01-15 14:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235148, 449760, 66952, '<td valign="top">A good choice of subject, and great timing on the sugar cube drop. Ways to get a better score....On camera flash is pretty harsh, especially from so close, and it takes away any sense of depth to the shot. You definitely need softer light. Even tracing paper placed over the flash will help. Since the focus should be on the sugar cube, do everything you can to put the focus there. Get rid of extra detail, the patterned cup, the wood grain table. Get a plain cup, and sit it on top of a piece of dark paper. Another thing would be the focus. I''d like to see the whole top of the cup in focus.</td>', 'A good choice of subject, and great timing on the sugar cube drop. Ways to get a better score....On camera flash is pretty harsh, especially from so close, and it takes away any sense of depth to the shot. You definitely need softer light. Even tracing paper placed over the flash will help. Since the focus should be on the sugar cube, do everything you can to put the focus there. Get rid of extra detail, the patterned cup, the wood grain table. Get a plain cup, and sit it on top of a piece of dark paper. Another thing would be the focus. I''d like to see the whole top of the cup in focus.', '2007-01-15 14:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235157, 448720, 66952, '<td valign="top">It''s not a bad shot, although her hair is a bit green. But when I see pictures of little girls in makeup and off the shoulder dresses in sultry poses, I start thinking of Jon Benet Ramsey and get kinda creeped out. I''m sure that''s not what you intended, but that''s my impression of the shot. Sorry.</td>', 'It''s not a bad shot, although her hair is a bit green. But when I see pictures of little girls in makeup and off the shoulder dresses in sultry poses, I start thinking of Jon Benet Ramsey and get kinda creeped out. I''m sure that''s not what you intended, but that''s my impression of the shot. Sorry.', '2007-01-15 14:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235162, 450794, 46314, '<td valign="top">Funny. A little macabre, but certainly makes you look twice.</td>', 'Funny. A little macabre, but certainly makes you look twice.', '2007-01-15 14:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235166, 449789, 66952, '<td valign="top">I guess I don''t know what the picture has to do with the song title.</td>', 'I guess I don''t know what the picture has to do with the song title.', '2007-01-15 14:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235170, 448258, 46314, '<td valign="top">I don''t think it communicates the idea clearly enough to me. Perhaps the DOF should have been more selective, so that the other distracting book titles are obscured.</td>', 'I don''t think it communicates the idea clearly enough to me. Perhaps the DOF should have been more selective, so that the other distracting book titles are obscured.', '2007-01-15 14:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235184, 449898, 46314, '<td valign="top">This is probably one of the best executed of all the people who used this idea. I like how the full flow of sugar into cup gets seen. The reflection of the cup is a nice touch, although the reflection of the sugar seems a bit lost down there in the darkness.</td>', 'This is probably one of the best executed of all the people who used this idea. I like how the full flow of sugar into cup gets seen. The reflection of the cup is a nice touch, although the reflection of the sugar seems a bit lost down there in the darkness.', '2007-01-15 14:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235189, 449714, 46314, '<td valign="top">Another well mimicked shot based on the music video. Good DOF - obscures the secret identity well, but gets the message across clearly.</td>', 'Another well mimicked shot based on the music video. Good DOF - obscures the secret identity well, but gets the message across clearly.', '2007-01-15 14:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235191, 450591, 66952, '<td valign="top">It''s a decent fish picture, but I don''t know what it has to do with the challenge.</td>', 'It''s a decent fish picture, but I don''t know what it has to do with the challenge.', '2007-01-15 14:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235193, 449248, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice range of colours. I like how the yellow hangs from the top, and how the red sticks out.</td>', 'Nice range of colours. I like how the yellow hangs from the top, and how the red sticks out.', '2007-01-15 14:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235200, 450800, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice tones. Looks like a gothic horror...</td>', 'Nice tones. Looks like a gothic horror...', '2007-01-15 14:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235215, 449791, 46314, '<td valign="top">I wish you''d captured this shot a fraction of a second later when her hips where in the sideways gyrating posture - that really would have emphasised the hops as referred to in the title...</td>', 'I wish you''d captured this shot a fraction of a second later when her hips where in the sideways gyrating posture - that really would have emphasised the hops as referred to in the title...', '2007-01-15 14:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235223, 448736, 46314, '<td valign="top">Not enough strength in the composition. The eye wants to follow the slope down into the ''far away'' that is referred to in the title, but that telephone pole stops it from doing so.</td>', 'Not enough strength in the composition. The eye wants to follow the slope down into the ''far away'' that is referred to in the title, but that telephone pole stops it from doing so.', '2007-01-15 14:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235235, 448923, 46314, '<td valign="top">Neat composition. DOF is used well, but the blue heart seems a bit soft. Lighting is a bit blown out though in areas where you''d expect it to be darker (if the background buttons were darker, it would draw emphasis to the main subject better).</td>', 'Neat composition. DOF is used well, but the blue heart seems a bit soft. Lighting is a bit blown out though in areas where you''d expect it to be darker (if the background buttons were darker, it would draw emphasis to the main subject better).', '2007-01-15 14:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235271, 449655, 46314, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, but doesn''t hold much other interest, other than its value as a stock photo.</td>', 'Neat shot, but doesn''t hold much other interest, other than its value as a stock photo.', '2007-01-15 14:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235324, 447698, 46314, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture. Because the bike is partially hidden, it almost looks like the rider is crouched on that log. Makes you look twice.</td>', 'Interesting capture. Because the bike is partially hidden, it almost looks like the rider is crouched on that log. Makes you look twice.', '2007-01-15 14:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235333, 448884, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like the subdued lighting.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like the subdued lighting.', '2007-01-15 14:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235361, 449475, 46314, '<td valign="top">Scary! Goes well with the title.</td>', 'Scary! Goes well with the title.', '2007-01-15 15:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235414, 450070, 46314, '<td valign="top">Awesome tones and brilliant use of hyperfocal distance. This photo seems to stretch on forever. Nice photo.</td>', 'Awesome tones and brilliant use of hyperfocal distance. This photo seems to stretch on forever. Nice photo.', '2007-01-15 15:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235415, 450831, 46314, '<td valign="top">Interesting character.</td>', 'Interesting character.', '2007-01-15 15:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235418, 448711, 46314, '<td valign="top">Not a very interesting photo. Your subjects are indistinguishable, so all that''s left is a very ordinary cloud scene.</td>', 'Not a very interesting photo. Your subjects are indistinguishable, so all that''s left is a very ordinary cloud scene.', '2007-01-15 15:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235423, 450229, 46314, '<td valign="top">Interesting metaphor. The photo could have been executed better. Light is too harsh, and centred composition seems rushed.</td>', 'Interesting metaphor. The photo could have been executed better. Light is too harsh, and centred composition seems rushed.', '2007-01-15 15:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235431, 448186, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice representation of crazy. Not sure what the bicycle rim is there for (other than to lead the eye away from the strong subject...). Nice tones. What would have made it superb was if the angles/lines/composition had been a bit crazier to complement the overall theme. Good anyway.</td>', 'Nice representation of crazy. Not sure what the bicycle rim is there for (other than to lead the eye away from the strong subject...). Nice tones. What would have made it superb was if the angles/lines/composition had been a bit crazier to complement the overall theme. Good anyway.', '2007-01-15 15:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235433, 448510, 46314, '<td valign="top">Captured the correct pose for the title.</td>', 'Captured the correct pose for the title.', '2007-01-15 15:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235446, 449132, 46314, '<td valign="top">Great capture for this title. Lips are so prominent. Could have used a bit more contrast though - tones seem a bit flat.</td>', 'Great capture for this title. Lips are so prominent. Could have used a bit more contrast though - tones seem a bit flat.', '2007-01-15 15:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235454, 449730, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice strong capture. I like the broad tonal range, and everthing is razor sharp - good DOF.</td>', 'Nice strong capture. I like the broad tonal range, and everthing is razor sharp - good DOF.', '2007-01-15 15:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235456, 449639, 46314, '<td valign="top">Not so fond of the blurring all around.</td>', 'Not so fond of the blurring all around.', '2007-01-15 15:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235459, 450584, 46314, '<td valign="top">I think elements of the photo speak to the title, but I''d like to have scene the composition simplified and tidied up.</td>', 'I think elements of the photo speak to the title, but I''d like to have scene the composition simplified and tidied up.', '2007-01-15 15:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235466, 449628, 46314, '<td valign="top">Far away indeed. A nice landscape, but lacking an ingredient that woul dmake it a stunning landscape.</td>', 'Far away indeed. A nice landscape, but lacking an ingredient that woul dmake it a stunning landscape.', '2007-01-15 15:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235472, 450294, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice literal representation of the metaphor. Cleanly shot - good lighting and focus. And those legs and skirt hint at the truth behind the imagery...</td>', 'Nice literal representation of the metaphor. Cleanly shot - good lighting and focus. And those legs and skirt hint at the truth behind the imagery...', '2007-01-15 15:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235474, 450803, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, but not enough emphasis on the lips, as I''d expect from that title. Also, the tonal range is quite flat - could''ve used more contrast.</td>', 'Nice portrait, but not enough emphasis on the lips, as I''d expect from that title. Also, the tonal range is quite flat - could''ve used more contrast.', '2007-01-15 15:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235479, 449598, 46314, '<td valign="top">Funny candid. Something we call all relate to. Could have been cropped tighter. That would have emphasised that naughty look more.</td>', 'Funny candid. Something we call all relate to. Could have been cropped tighter. That would have emphasised that naughty look more.', '2007-01-15 15:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235481, 448762, 46314, '<td valign="top">The sentimentality is conveyed well. Decent shot.</td>', 'The sentimentality is conveyed well. Decent shot.', '2007-01-15 15:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235486, 447022, 46314, '<td valign="top">Another temperature gauge for the stock photo album... Would have been better it more feelings of temperature had been conveyed (cool blues, or hot reds...)</td>', 'Another temperature gauge for the stock photo album... Would have been better it more feelings of temperature had been conveyed (cool blues, or hot reds...)', '2007-01-15 15:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235490, 449620, 46314, '<td valign="top">i like those specks of spray on the left. Makes me wonder what''s going on over there. And he looks surreally suspended in mid air.</td>', 'i like those specks of spray on the left. Makes me wonder what''s going on over there. And he looks surreally suspended in mid air.', '2007-01-15 15:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235498, 449859, 46314, '<td valign="top">Dirty indeed.</td>', 'Dirty indeed.', '2007-01-15 15:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235504, 449495, 46314, '<td valign="top">Could have done so much more with that interesting device. All that wonderful glass and colour deserved better lighting.</td>', 'Could have done so much more with that interesting device. All that wonderful glass and colour deserved better lighting.', '2007-01-15 15:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235508, 449410, 46314, '<td valign="top">Er, yes, it is a photograph. Doesn''t really represent the title though, does it?</td>', 'Er, yes, it is a photograph. Doesn''t really represent the title though, does it?', '2007-01-15 15:31:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3235512, 449903, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice tight jeans. Good focus and tones.</td>', 'Nice tight jeans. Good focus and tones.', '2007-01-15 15:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235517, 450849, 46314, '<td valign="top">The pose is very intimate and sincere. I like that. However the totally blown out background is very cold and doesn''t add to the warmth in their gaze. Quite harsh lighting for older people. In fact, a colour shot might have added some of that warmth and tenderness that the photo is lacking.</td>', 'The pose is very intimate and sincere. I like that. However the totally blown out background is very cold and doesn''t add to the warmth in their gaze. Quite harsh lighting for older people. In fact, a colour shot might have added some of that warmth and tenderness that the photo is lacking.', '2007-01-15 15:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235527, 447299, 46314, '<td valign="top">Um, not quite sure if this communicates the title very well. I mean, given the title, I can imagine what''s going on in her head, but without the title, I''m not sure what the photo would have said to me. Nice lighting and colour though.</td>', 'Um, not quite sure if this communicates the title very well. I mean, given the title, I can imagine what''s going on in her head, but without the title, I''m not sure what the photo would have said to me. Nice lighting and colour though.', '2007-01-15 15:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235537, 448767, 46314, '<td valign="top">Haha. This is the funniest of the lot. Thank you for the laugh. Very well composed.</td>', 'Haha. This is the funniest of the lot. Thank you for the laugh. Very well composed.', '2007-01-15 15:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235544, 450839, 46314, '<td valign="top">Lol. I like the woody photo album. That''s quite a treasure. Good work, nicely shot.</td>', 'Lol. I like the woody photo album. That''s quite a treasure. Good work, nicely shot.', '2007-01-15 15:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235552, 447061, 46314, '<td valign="top">If you think so... Not a great entry. Too small, to obscure.</td>', 'If you think so... Not a great entry. Too small, to obscure.', '2007-01-15 15:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235561, 447025, 46314, '<td valign="top">Nice minimalist photo. I like the composition and lighting. Don''t know if it represents the title well enough though.</td>', 'Nice minimalist photo. I like the composition and lighting. Don''t know if it represents the title well enough though.', '2007-01-15 15:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3235574, 448664, 46314, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting. The juxtaposition of a dark silhouette and the bright porpoise? is brilliant. That black band at the bottom disrupts the balance a bit, maybe you could crop it.</td>', 'I love the lighting. The juxtaposition of a dark silhouette and the bright porpoise? is brilliant. That black band at the bottom disrupts the balance a bit, maybe you could crop it.', '2007-01-15 15:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
