(3235610, 448618, 46314, '<td valign="top">Good expression. The photo is a bit awkwardly cropped though, but the b&amp;w conversion was handled well.</td>', 'Good expression. The photo is a bit awkwardly cropped though, but the b&w conversion was handled well.', '2007-01-15 15:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
