(3241377, 448871, 67739, '<td valign="top">this has to be on of the better ocean scenes that i seen in a while, the wave really make this show. As well the time of day. The colors in the sky and clouds are great. A simple and obvious use of the title to the image, but not too simple to the point where its bad, great work.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-17 09:07:03.</i></td>', 'this has to be on of the better ocean scenes that i seen in a while, the wave really make this show. As well the time of day. The colors in the sky and clouds are great. A simple and obvious use of the title to the image, but not too simple to the point where its bad, great work.', '2007-01-16 17:27:06.000000', '2007-01-17 09:07:03.000000', 1),
(3241402, 449792, 67739, '<td valign="top">i love the reflections and the colors. Ithink it might have come out better with larger DoF. It might just be me but it doesnt look too sharp and i think sharpness would really add to this. i like the composition  too, maybe somewhat more of an accentuated angle might add a little fire to it.</td>', 'i love the reflections and the colors. Ithink it might have come out better with larger DoF. It might just be me but it doesnt look too sharp and i think sharpness would really add to this. i like the composition  too, maybe somewhat more of an accentuated angle might add a little fire to it.', '2007-01-16 17:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3241421, 450839, 67739, '<td valign="top">i love this. The frame in the backgroun just makes it. My ONLY problem is that one sliver between the far right frame and the middle. that little sliver of white snatches my consentration away from the foreground but over all a great shot.</td>', 'i love this. The frame in the backgroun just makes it. My ONLY problem is that one sliver between the far right frame and the middle. that little sliver of white snatches my consentration away from the foreground but over all a great shot.', '2007-01-16 17:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
