(3243993, 448696, 20168, '<td valign="top">Hey, nipped your hotshot bro by a vote! Way to step into DPCland and place in the top 30! Great photo. I attempted to straighten out the horizon on this photo when I first looked at it and realized then that it is straight, but the bright logs in the water create an optical illusion making the whole thing look a bit tippy. What a sunbreak though! Thanks for a sweet entry.</td>', 'Hey, nipped your hotshot bro by a vote! Way to step into DPCland and place in the top 30! Great photo. I attempted to straighten out the horizon on this photo when I first looked at it and realized then that it is straight, but the bright logs in the water create an optical illusion making the whole thing look a bit tippy. What a sunbreak though! Thanks for a sweet entry.', '2007-01-17 01:18:51.000000', NULL, 0),
