(3244769, 450632, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Love the interpretation!  Reds are very strong, good capture of the candle flames (which is hard to do!) and the devil is just plain cheeky.  My only nit would be that it takes a second to see the hand.  Just a touch more light coming from over the right shoulder would have provided some illumination on the hand and the page.  Still, quite the delightful response to the challenge!</td>', 'LOL!  Love the interpretation!  Reds are very strong, good capture of the candle flames (which is hard to do!) and the devil is just plain cheeky.  My only nit would be that it takes a second to see the hand.  Just a touch more light coming from over the right shoulder would have provided some illumination on the hand and the page.  Still, quite the delightful response to the challenge!', '2007-01-17 05:38:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3244770, 449866, 55838, '<td valign="top">So wonderfully sweet and I''m so happy it did so well.  Just magical.  Congratulations!!  Adding to favorites.</td>', 'So wonderfully sweet and I''m so happy it did so well.  Just magical.  Congratulations!!  Adding to favorites.', '2007-01-17 05:38:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3244780, 449760, 30982, '<td valign="top">For a first attempt (and a lot of sugar cubes) I''d say you did pretty darn well!  I''m betting that you''d have scored about a half point higher if you''d cropped a lot closer - get more detail of the splash and the sugar cube.  (Just read through the comments and I see this has already been suggested... probably should read first, huh?)</td>', 'For a first attempt (and a lot of sugar cubes) I''d say you did pretty darn well!  I''m betting that you''d have scored about a half point higher if you''d cropped a lot closer - get more detail of the splash and the sugar cube.  (Just read through the comments and I see this has already been suggested... probably should read first, huh?)', '2007-01-17 05:41:50.000000', NULL, 0),
