(3245531, 449450, 66348, '<td valign="top">Just a beautiful shot, awesome idea, the colors are insane good, and I love the motion of the ocean. :P</td>', 'Just a beautiful shot, awesome idea, the colors are insane good, and I love the motion of the ocean. :P', '2007-01-17 08:32:38.000000', NULL, 0),
