(3245570, 450460, 68586, '<td valign="top">Top 30 place on her 2nd entry . .I''m so proud of her !!<br/>Actually she''s done better than me - maybe I should be asking for advice from her :-)</td>', 'Top 30 place on her 2nd entry . .I''m so proud of her !!Actually she''s done better than me - maybe I should be asking for advice from her :-)', '2007-01-17 08:37:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3245596, 449192, 67612, '<td valign="top">This was a quick shot with my camera phone, that was why it was some grainy.  I cropped her as best I thought would "tell the story".  I don''t think you would have gotten the hospital feel from the picture had it been a tight crop on just my daughter.  I felt you needed to see a little of the hospital.</td>', 'This was a quick shot with my camera phone, that was why it was some grainy.  I cropped her as best I thought would "tell the story".  I don''t think you would have gotten the hospital feel from the picture had it been a tight crop on just my daughter.  I felt you needed to see a little of the hospital.', '2007-01-17 08:40:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3245620, 448258, 68586, '<td valign="top">Very clever (and great first entry) - glad you managed to sign up. Now you can be a slave to the update button like the rest of us :-)</td>', 'Very clever (and great first entry) - glad you managed to sign up. Now you can be a slave to the update button like the rest of us :-)', '2007-01-17 08:44:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(3245626, 450796, 43298, '<td valign="top">YAHOO! Congrats on thop ten with this awesome pic! You pulled your idea off great!<br/> <br/>And I LOVE Nick Lachey.<br/> <br/>Just kidding, I swear.</td>', 'YAHOO! Congrats on thop ten with this awesome pic! You pulled your idea off great! And I LOVE Nick Lachey. Just kidding, I swear.', '2007-01-17 08:45:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3245634, 450126, 43298, '<td valign="top">Wow! Congrats on top ten! It''s a great photo!</td>', 'Wow! Congrats on top ten! It''s a great photo!', '2007-01-17 08:46:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3245636, 448736, 37250, '<td valign="top">Hi, and thanks to all who took the time to look, vote and especially to thoses who opted to comment.  <br/> <br/>In all honesty, it is exactly what you see.  This is the lowest building of a buddhist temple in the NamHanSanSeoung complex just outside of Seoul, South Korea.  The hues and tints were adjusted due to a whitwashed sky, some people like the color version but I prefer the post processed version.  The set up, well I am basically about 50 feet above the building which gives me a view of the range, netered the light on the building and pulled the trigger.  Gor home, liked the shot, processed it and sent it off.  As for the cell tower, sadly, it is a real tree that they stripped to look like a pole, and not the other way around.  Also, I''ve been to deep and dark Africa where you''d expect no one to have been before and find one of thoses bloody towers, hee hee, so I still thinks this counts as Far away.<br/> <br/>Cheers,<br/> <br/>Eric...</td>', 'Hi, and thanks to all who took the time to look, vote and especially to thoses who opted to comment.   In all honesty, it is exactly what you see.  This is the lowest building of a buddhist temple in the NamHanSanSeoung complex just outside of Seoul, South Korea.  The hues and tints were adjusted due to a whitwashed sky, some people like the color version but I prefer the post processed version.  The set up, well I am basically about 50 feet above the building which gives me a view of the range, netered the light on the building and pulled the trigger.  Gor home, liked the shot, processed it and sent it off.  As for the cell tower, sadly, it is a real tree that they stripped to look like a pole, and not the other way around.  Also, I''ve been to deep and dark Africa where you''d expect no one to have been before and find one of thoses bloody towers, hee hee, so I still thinks this counts as Far away. Cheers, Eric...', '2007-01-17 08:46:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3245657, 450020, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice work.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice work.  Well done.', '2007-01-17 08:51:10.000000', NULL, 0),
