(3246441, 447698, 67671, '<td valign="top">as many of you noticed the lack of motion I should explain, I was alone on the bike, with a tank bag, I only had room for a small tripod, so setting the cameraas high as the pod would go, about14inch, set the self timer, and run round and sit on the bike, right foot on the ground, I no it would have been better if the log was a bit smaller, it was good fun doing it, as was the ride over there and back, Thanks for all the comments. Ken</td>', 'as many of you noticed the lack of motion I should explain, I was alone on the bike, with a tank bag, I only had room for a small tripod, so setting the cameraas high as the pod would go, about14inch, set the self timer, and run round and sit on the bike, right foot on the ground, I no it would have been better if the log was a bit smaller, it was good fun doing it, as was the ride over there and back, Thanks for all the comments. Ken', '2007-01-17 11:59:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3246448, 450868, 60862, '<td valign="top">Wow - good backward writing!  You have neater handwriting backward than I do forward. :)  I like the shot overall.  Gotta love our camera and selective desat!</td>', 'Wow - good backward writing!  You have neater handwriting backward than I do forward. :)  I like the shot overall.  Gotta love our camera and selective desat!', '2007-01-17 12:01:46.000000', NULL, 0),
