(3247373, 450834, 66597, '<td valign="top">Highly underrated. This was one of the best photos in the challenge IMHO. Love the weird colors, the spooky feeling, the way the horizon looks skewed even though it is straight. Plus I burst out laughing when I opened it - always a good thing! Nice humps, er pumps :-)</td>', 'Highly underrated. This was one of the best photos in the challenge IMHO. Love the weird colors, the spooky feeling, the way the horizon looks skewed even though it is straight. Plus I burst out laughing when I opened it - always a good thing! Nice humps, er pumps :-)', '2007-01-17 14:44:04.000000', NULL, 0),
