(3249030, 450800, 32997, '<td valign="top">I am too tired from reading your comments to take in the shot...will have to come back later...<br/>edit: I am back...I think this has the  feel of a painting...the dabs in the foreground..inky looking sides of the building...maybe that makes it an ink drawing...oh no you are starting to realize I don''t know what I am talking about...ok let me say this...the darkening effect of the tritone works well here, as the key bits of info are all present, and it adds a stark look to the overall shot...you did a nice job with the foreground, giving it a painterly look (can''t blame me for trying...)...<br/>ahem...cool looking shot<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-17 21:21:52.</i></td>', 'I am too tired from reading your comments to take in the shot...will have to come back later...edit: I am back...I think this has the  feel of a painting...the dabs in the foreground..inky looking sides of the building...maybe that makes it an ink drawing...oh no you are starting to realize I don''t know what I am talking about...ok let me say this...the darkening effect of the tritone works well here, as the key bits of info are all present, and it adds a stark look to the overall shot...you did a nice job with the foreground, giving it a painterly look (can''t blame me for trying...)...ahem...cool looking shot', '2007-01-17 21:16:10.000000', '2007-01-17 21:21:52.000000', 0),
(3249069, 449449, 32997, '<td valign="top">great angle..question: why didn''t you simply crop out the right side?...<br/>(I don''t quite get the border thing...it doesn''t bug me, but your comment confuses me)<br/>edited to add: oh yah I like it!<br/>and hey this is my 2000th comment given!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-17 21:27:28.</i></td>', 'great angle..question: why didn''t you simply crop out the right side?...(I don''t quite get the border thing...it doesn''t bug me, but your comment confuses me)edited to add: oh yah I like it!and hey this is my 2000th comment given!', '2007-01-17 21:25:45.000000', '2007-01-17 21:27:28.000000', 0),
(3249301, 449866, 7810, '<td valign="top">Congrats Sandy ... what a great capture!</td>', 'Congrats Sandy ... what a great capture!', '2007-01-17 22:10:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3249340, 449449, 35669, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bucket:</b></div><hr/><i> great angle..question: why didn''t you simply crop out the right side?...<br/>(I don''t quite get the border thing...it doesn''t bug me, but your comment confuses me)<br/>edited to add: oh yah I like it!<br/>and hey this is my 2000th comment given! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Cheers Rob,<br/>The reason I didnt just lop off the right hand side and leave it at that was I felt that the image was too "heavy" on the left to be able to do that and it also would have centred the wheel (well, just off centre actually) and that annoyed me too.  I knew the border would have been an issue for some people but for me it balanced the image.  This is actually my second edit of this the fist one I completely burned out the trailor and building and even the ground was black, I will post that if I remember. I wish I could have entered that edit as it looks cool as hell and it really would have given the "too dark" voters the shits.</td>', 'Originally posted by bucket: great angle..question: why didn''t you simply crop out the right side?...(I don''t quite get the border thing...it doesn''t bug me, but your comment confuses me)edited to add: oh yah I like it!and hey this is my 2000th comment given!   Cheers Rob,The reason I didnt just lop off the right hand side and leave it at that was I felt that the image was too "heavy" on the left to be able to do that and it also would have centred the wheel (well, just off centre actually) and that annoyed me too.  I knew the border would have been an issue for some people but for me it balanced the image.  This is actually my second edit of this the fist one I completely burned out the trailor and building and even the ground was black, I will post that if I remember. I wish I could have entered that edit as it looks cool as hell and it really would have given the "too dark" voters the shits.', '2007-01-17 22:16:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3249476, 450020, 51750, '<td valign="top">I used to go there all the time as a child, i miss it. Ill be going back next june i think when i return to my native country for a visit though. Im not really sure if this is legal though, you did edit out oalot of stuff.</td>', 'I used to go there all the time as a child, i miss it. Ill be going back next june i think when i return to my native country for a visit though. Im not really sure if this is legal though, you did edit out oalot of stuff.', '2007-01-17 22:56:47.000000', NULL, 0),
