(3255072, 449929, 47534, '<td valign="top">James,<br/> <br/>Your eye for this has definitely improved and, for the record, I thought this was done by cindi too (like Ken).  That says alot, as we all love her work, and you''re obviously headed in the right direction.<br/> <br/>Neither you nor your wife should be at all unhappy with this!  Nevermind placement in the challenge - enjoy the nature of the work ;) - and enjoy your time together... Being relaxed &amp; having fun together WILL shine through in the results, and you have that here.  Bravo Mr. (and MRS.!!!)Stanton, Bravo.</td>', 'James, Your eye for this has definitely improved and, for the record, I thought this was done by cindi too (like Ken).  That says alot, as we all love her work, and you''re obviously headed in the right direction. Neither you nor your wife should be at all unhappy with this!  Nevermind placement in the challenge - enjoy the nature of the work ;) - and enjoy your time together... Being relaxed & having fun together WILL shine through in the results, and you have that here.  Bravo Mr. (and MRS.!!!)Stanton, Bravo.', '2007-01-19 09:12:12.000000', NULL, 0),
