(3268321, 448884, 22301, '<td valign="top">Todd, I hope to be like you one day. Beautiful wife, beautiful kids, and a bunch of photo studio equipment :). Congrats on your 19th place finish and your awesome life!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-01-22 20:30:12.</i></td>', 'Todd, I hope to be like you one day. Beautiful wife, beautiful kids, and a bunch of photo studio equipment :). Congrats on your 19th place finish and your awesome life!', '2007-01-22 19:58:56.000000', '2007-01-22 20:30:12.000000', 0),
