(3271543, 450464, 811, '<td valign="top">CRITIQUE CLUB CRITIQUE<br/>by karmat<br/> <br/>Compositionally, I really likewhat you are doing here.  The only things I might suggest are to move the horn down in the frame a bit more.  Right now, it just looks like an ornate piece of metal, and you don''t really get the feeling of it being a musical instrument.  Also, and this is probably just the music major in me, a pen would have seemed more realistic to me for some reason.  I assume most writers do their initial stuff in pencil, but a pen just seems a bit more "artistic."  Again, that may just be me.<br/> <br/>Technically, the focus is good and the exposure is good, though I think a bit more light overall would help the details be a bit more visible.<br/> <br/>Overall, I think you had a nice shot here.  It met the challenge, I believe, and has a nice storytelling quality about it.  <br/> <br/>If I need to further clarify or explain, please do not hesitate to contact me.<br/> <br/>karmat</td>', 'CRITIQUE CLUB CRITIQUEby karmat Compositionally, I really likewhat you are doing here.  The only things I might suggest are to move the horn down in the frame a bit more.  Right now, it just looks like an ornate piece of metal, and you don''t really get the feeling of it being a musical instrument.  Also, and this is probably just the music major in me, a pen would have seemed more realistic to me for some reason.  I assume most writers do their initial stuff in pencil, but a pen just seems a bit more "artistic."  Again, that may just be me. Technically, the focus is good and the exposure is good, though I think a bit more light overall would help the details be a bit more visible. Overall, I think you had a nice shot here.  It met the challenge, I believe, and has a nice storytelling quality about it.   If I need to further clarify or explain, please do not hesitate to contact me. karmat', '2007-01-23 16:33:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(3272010, 449866, 57886, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture Sandy. OMG look how much they resamble humans. You can see from the mothers expression how much she loves her youngster :o) One of the best animal pictures I have ever seen. Congrats on a well deserved ribbon :o)</td>', 'Beautiful picture Sandy. OMG look how much they resamble humans. You can see from the mothers expression how much she loves her youngster :o) One of the best animal pictures I have ever seen. Congrats on a well deserved ribbon :o)', '2007-01-23 18:20:40.000000', NULL, 0),
