(3273867, 449346, 60505, '<td valign="top">Very nice job with the buttons. the printing on the thread label I found a little distracting as it took away from the "old" feel you achieved with the lighting. The glass bowl was a major compositional element, dividing the picture in thirds. 1/3 in the bowl, 1/3 triangle shape of buttons at the base, and 1/3 upper left with the reel of thread. I liked your framing too. I would take the buttons and play some more with them and differennt lighting and maybe some other props, (cloth swaths, thread, wool, fur, plastic etc) I love the details in your buttons and the contrast in the silver colored vs gold vs brass buttons, the dull ones vs the shiny ones etc. Have fun and welcome to DPC.<br/>I''m glad you like the photo of my daughter!</td>', 'Very nice job with the buttons. the printing on the thread label I found a little distracting as it took away from the "old" feel you achieved with the lighting. The glass bowl was a major compositional element, dividing the picture in thirds. 1/3 in the bowl, 1/3 triangle shape of buttons at the base, and 1/3 upper left with the reel of thread. I liked your framing too. I would take the buttons and play some more with them and differennt lighting and maybe some other props, (cloth swaths, thread, wool, fur, plastic etc) I love the details in your buttons and the contrast in the silver colored vs gold vs brass buttons, the dull ones vs the shiny ones etc. Have fun and welcome to DPC.I''m glad you like the photo of my daughter!', '2007-01-24 02:46:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3274172, 449849, 30982, '<td valign="top">You met your objectives very well in my opinion!  Very good use of depth of field and the focus on the lettering is perfect.  I like it on the paper bag, too.  Fingernails are a nice touch - they kinda match the jacket.  Very nice work with this!</td>', 'You met your objectives very well in my opinion!  Very good use of depth of field and the focus on the lettering is perfect.  I like it on the paper bag, too.  Fingernails are a nice touch - they kinda match the jacket.  Very nice work with this!', '2007-01-24 04:44:09.000000', NULL, 0),
